      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YARRAMUNDI GO GO (5) is a promising dog in the frame at three of 12 starts including six wins and was a last start winner (19.57) over 350m at Murray Bridge Straight. On top here on best form and expected to feature. MOLLEY MACALLAN (2) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 30.49 beating Lockerbie. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. ZINFANDEL ZOOM (8) is a handy dog who jumped from box 8 last time out and scored by 1.3 lengths at Murray Bridge Straight (16.89). Some good form is emerging from his last run. Sure to measure up. KILCOY GEM (7) was below best last time at this track (26.39) in a Grade 6, finishing a 7 length fourth. Has four wins already from this draw.",
